Plan: remove the whole mirror mirror-0 (the pair that contains ata-A) from 'bulk'

Command:
  zpool remove bulk mirror-0

The mirror will be removed. About 2.0GB of data move to the other mirrors, which have 3.0GB free.
This can take hours; the pool stays usable. Cancel with: zpool remove -s bulk
ZFS keeps a small mapping table for the removed data until it is rewritten.

Dry run: nothing changed.
